---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Panda's Playhouse"
  description="A membership website for an online gaming community that had outgrown its Facebook page, built on Wix Studio with Velo so the owners' team could maintain it themselves."
  client="Panda's Playhouse"
  role="UX design and Wix Studio development"
  year="2023"
  slides={[
    {
      title: 'Step 1: Figma design',
      src: '/images/web-development-project-pandas-playhouse-ui-design.png',
      poster: '/images/hifi-img.svg',
      type: 'image',
      alt: "High-fidelity Figma design of the Panda's Playhouse homepage",
    },
    {
      title: 'Step 2: Prototype',
      src: '/videos/web-development-project-pandas-playhouse-prototype.mp4',
      poster: '/images/panda-prototype.svg',
    },
    {
      title: 'Step 3: Development',
      src: '/videos/web-development-project-pandas-playhouse-development.mp4',
      poster: '/images/panda-development.svg',
    },
  ]}
  highlights={[
    { value: '5,000+ members', label: 'Moved from Facebook to their own website' },
    { value: 'ID verification', label: 'Facial verification for new sign-ups through a third-party API' },
    { value: 'Members area', label: 'A members-only section and a virtual currency system' },
  ]}
  overview={[
    'Panda\'s Playhouse had grown to more than 5,000 active members through Facebook ads and needed a proper membership website. The requirements were identity verification for new members, a members-only area, a way to manage their virtual currency and a site that worked well on phones. The owners wanted it built on Wix so their virtual assistants could update it without hiring a developer.',
    'We started with low-fidelity wireframes to work out the flow from the landing page to a signed-in member, then moved to high-fidelity designs and a clickable prototype in Figma. Development started after the flow and colors were approved.',
    'I used Wix Studio\'s Velo layer to build the custom parts: a facial verification step using a third-party API, a members-only area, and the virtual currency system used inside the community. The site is responsive and works across browsers.',
  ]}
  tools={['Wix Studio', 'JavaScript (Velo)', 'Third-party APIs', 'CSS', 'Figma']}
/>
